# Local-only real identity entries (e.g. your own real Slack account, for
# testing against a real workspace) — use config/local_identity.example.yaml
# as the template. Never commit real personal data into config/identity.yaml
# itself, which ships containing only fictitious mock users.
config/local_identity.yaml
